Package: fosos-theme
Version: 0.1.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: greybird-gtk-theme, elementary-xfce-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-liberation, dmz-cursor-theme, plymouth, xfce4-power-manager, xfce4-settings, xfdesktop4, lxpolkit
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS desktop branding and defaults
 Wallpaper, boot splash, login appearance, and XFCE defaults.
 The GTK theme is Greybird, the icon theme is elementary-xfce,
 and the cursor is DMZ-White. The XFCE session starts lxpolkit so
 password prompts work.
